!!Characters and Backstories
*Alpha (temporary name) - the main protagonist, a young boy from Earth.
*Beta (temporary name) - Alpha's female friend, a Lobgugde native who has been an exchange student on Earth for a month and has returned to Lobgugde with Alpha.
*Chocolate - Alpha's stuffed moose toy, animates at various times.
*Alpha's mum
*Alpha's dad
*General

Concept artwork for main characters: [http://jbotcan.org/en/res/1538.html|http://jbotcan.org/en/res/1538.html]

