!!Technologies
*2D Animation
**Probably [http://www.synfig.org/|Synfig Studio] (open source, cross platform)
**Possibly [http://www.adobe.com/products/flash/|Adobe Flash] (proprietary, cross platform)
*3D Animation
**Will probably not be done (only for tiny gimmicks), and if used is likely to be cell-shaded so that individual frames would be indistinguishable from the 2D animation style
**[http://usa.autodesk.com/adsk/servlet/pc/index?siteID=123112&id=13577897|Maya] (if we use 3D, it may be in Maya as that's what the keyframer will have available) (proprietary, cross platform)
**[http://www.blender.org/|Blender] (open source, cross platform)
**[http://secondlife.com/|Second Life] machinima (suggestion by Mark Shoulson)

